## Use @HostBinding for Cleaner Code

Instead of manually setting `element.style.xxx`, you can bind directly to host properties:

```typescript
@HostBinding('style.backgroundColor') backgroundColor: string;

@HostListener('mouseenter') onMouseEnter() {
  this.backgroundColor = 'yellow';
}
```

This keeps your code testable and reduces direct DOM manipulation.
